          <rdf:li>Whump</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>...lots of it</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra Redemption</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>(sorta? she starts making less horrible decisions anyway)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>in which an angsty cat cares a lot more than she thinks she does and adora gets stabbed a lot</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>they may be half dead and running from killer beasts</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>but will that stop them from snarking at each other? absolutely not</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Graphic Depictions Of Violence</rdf:li>
